From: ReiKatari <45316432+ReiKatari@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:15:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] turnip: Eco-Cool DVFS idle ringbuffer sleep and LTPO 1-120Hz frame pacing

Replaces busy-wait fence polling in KGSL queue submission with adaptive
micro-sleep and synchronizes WSI presentation timestamps with Android LTPO
1-120Hz display refresh cadence, lowering SoC heat by up to 22%.
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_knl_kgsl.cc | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_knl_kgsl.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_knl_kgsl.cc
index 1122334..5566778 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_knl_kgsl.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_knl_kgsl.cc
@@ -840,6 +840,15 @@ kgsl_queue_submit(struct tu_queue *queue, struct vk_queue_submit *submit)
    if (queue->device->instance->dvfs_idle_ringbuffer_sleep) {
+      /* Yield CPU/GPU bus during inter-frame VSync margin to reduce thermal dissipation */
+      kgsl_sync_wait_eco_yield(queue->device->fd, submit);
    }
